        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "41ae9667-82dc-5747-a860-28a7418d7ea6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Driven To Perform, Import Showoff Canada\n- Places: Vancouver, British Columbia, Canada, Western Canada\n- Companies: Future Shop, Toyo Tires, Mobil1, Honda, Mazda, Lordco, Visions Electronics\n- Topics: auto shows, automotive lifestyles, electronics retail\n\nFacts:\n- Driven To Perform is an auto show billed as Western Canada's largest and most established automotive lifestyles tour.\n- Driven To Perform originally featured mainly import tuner sport compact cars.\n- The inaugural Driven To Perform show was held in Vancouver, British Columbia, in 2002 under the name Import Showoff Canada.\n- Driven To Perform later changed its name and expanded to include other vehicle types and other large metropolitan cities in that region of Canada.\n- Major sponsors of Driven To Perform include Toyo Tires, Future Shop, Mobil1, Honda, Mazda, Lordco, and Visions Electronics.\n- Future Shop was a Canadian electronics store chain.\n- In January 2013, Future Shop operated 139 locations across Canada.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "deba4bb3-8d94-55ea-97ff-c0f2e77f6100",
        "text": "Page: Driven To Perform. Sentence: Driven To Perform (DTP) is an auto show billed as Western Canada's largest and most established automotive lifestyles tour and originally featured mainly import tuner sport compact cars.\nPage: Driven To Perform. Sentence: The inaugural show was held in Vancouver, BC in 2002 as Import Showoff Canada, but has since changed its name and expanded to include other vehicle types and into the other large metropolitan cities in this region of Canada.\nPage: Driven To Perform. Sentence: Major sponsors include Toyo Tires, Future Shop, Mobil1, Honda, Mazda, Lordco and Visions Electronics.\nPage: Future Shop. Sentence: Future Shop was a Canadian electronics store chain.\nPage: Future Shop. Sentence: In January 2013, the company operated 139 locations across Canada.",
